<section class="section on-light" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="wrap why-grid"><div><h1 class="h2 section-label about-title" id="about-title">ABOUT THE PROGRAMME</h1><p class="why-statement reveal">We help students across Abia turn promising ideas into validated business opportunities and sustainable businesses.</p><div class="why-body reveal d1"><p>The Abia Tech Hub Student Startup Incubation Programme is a six-week programme for students who want to explore a problem, test a solution and learn what it takes to build a business.</p><p>Our goal is to make that first step more practical and accessible: give emerging founders useful guidance, hands-on training and a community to build alongside.</p></div></div><ol class="chain" id="chain" aria-label="What the programme helps founders do"><li class="chain-item"><svg class="chain-shape" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="draw" cx="50" cy="50" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#0A0E27" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 7"></circle><circle class="fill" cx="50" cy="50" r="9" fill="#0A0E27"></circle></svg><div><h3>Start with a problem</h3><p>Get clear about who experiences it and why it matters.</p></div></li><li class="chain-item"><svg class="chain-shape" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="draw" x="22" y="22" width="56" height="56" rx="4" transform="rotate(45 50 50)" fill="none" stroke="#0A0E27" stroke-width="3"></rect><path class="fill" d="M50 12 L88 50 L50 88 Z" fill="#0A0E27"></path></svg><div><h3>Test your thinking</h3><p>Talk to people, learn from evidence and refine your solution.</p></div></li><li class="chain-item"><svg class="chain-shape" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="draw" x="16" y="16" width="68" height="68" rx="8" fill="none" stroke="#0A0E27" stroke-width="3"></rect><rect class="fill" x="16" y="16" width="68" height="68" rx="8" fill="#0A0E27"></rect><rect class="fill" x="38" y="38" width="24" height="24" rx="3" transform="rotate(45 50 50)" fill="#FFFFFF"></rect></svg><div><h3>Build a strong foundation</h3><p>Leave with a clearer path to take your idea forward.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
